The legal text is the Конституція України (adopted 28 June 1996), in the revision of 1 January 2020, as published by the
Verkhovna Rada of Ukraine on Законодавство України (https://zakon.rada.gov.ua/laws/show/254%D0%BA/96-%D0%B2%D1%80),
read from an Internet Archive capture of 23 October 2026, retrieved 29 October 2026. The Verkhovna Rada's open data is
published under CC BY 4.0 (https://data.rada.gov.ua/open/main/api); the text of a law is an official document.

The Кримінальний кодекс України (2341-III of 5 April 2001) is likewise from https://zakon.rada.gov.ua/laws/show/2341-14, read from an Internet Archive capture, retrieved 30 October 2026.

The Цивільний кодекс України (435-IV of 16 January 2003) is likewise from https://zakon.rada.gov.ua/laws/show/435-15, read from an Internet Archive capture, retrieved 30 October 2026.

The Кримінальний процесуальний кодекс України (4651-VI of 13 April 2012) and the Кодекс законів про працю України (322-VIII of 10 December 1971) are likewise from https://zakon.rada.gov.ua/laws/show/4651-17 and https://zakon.rada.gov.ua/laws/show/322-08, read from Internet Archive captures, retrieved 30 October 2026.

Changes made by Lexifina: each version was converted to one Markdown file per provision, one paragraph per line;
spacing, quotes and dashes were normalised; headings, page numbers and footnote markers were left out; and the
versions were arranged as git commits credited to the publisher. The wording of the law was not changed. The
publisher does not endorse this repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) are
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
